  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program support to FLACSOs regional Central American Postgraduate Programme in the Social Sciences. Includes Masters and PhD programme focussed on democracy and human rights. The support includes also institutional support to the three FLACSO units in Central America, connected to the postgraduate programme. FLACSO means the Latin American Faculty of Social Science.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programst&#xF6;d till FLACSOs regionala centralamerikanska  forskarutbildningsprogram i samh&#xE4;llsvetenskap. Inkluderar masters och doktorandprogram med fokus p&#xE5; demokrati och MR. St&#xF6;det inkluderar &#xE4;ven organisationsst&#xF6;d till de tre FLACSO-enheterna i Centralamerika, kopplat till forskarutbildningsprogrammet. FLACSO st&#xE5;r f&#xF6;r den Latinamerikanska Fakulteten f&#xF6;r Samh&#xE4;llsvetenskap.</narrative>
  </description>
